            value: "#### Complete Summary of the Mandatory Requirements\r\r1.  One code in `Observation.code` which must have\r    -   a fixed `Observation.code.coding.system`=**\'http ://loinc.org\'**\r    -   a fixed  `Observation.code.coding.code`= **\'85353-1\'**\r    -   Other additional Codings are allowed in `Observation.code`- e.g. more specific LOINC\r        Codes, SNOMED CT concepts, system specific codes. All codes\r        SHALL have an system value\r1.  No value in `Observation.value[x]`\r1.  At Least one Vitals Sign Observation reference in `Observation.hasMember`"
