          short {
            value: "Implicit meaning when this element is missing"
          }
          definition {
            value: "The Implicit meaning that is to be understood when this element is missing (e.g. \'when this element is missing, the period is ongoing\')."
          }
          comment {
            value: "Implicit meanings for missing values can only be specified on a resource, data type, or extension definition, and never in a profile that applies to one of these. An implicit meaning for a missing value can never be changed, and specifying one has the consequence that constraining its use in profiles eliminates use cases as possibilities, not merely moving them out of scope.\r\n  This element should only be used on child elements of complex data elements."
          }
